说公司付不起新的博彩税。利兹和都柏林的员工受影响最大。伦敦、桑德兰、马耳他和直布罗陀的一些岗位也可能被裁。", "政府去年提高了线上博彩税。今年4月，线上赌场游戏的税率从21%涨到40%。明年4月，线上体育博彩的税率将从15%涨到25%。", "Flutter在全球有28500名员工，其中9000人在英国和爱尔兰。截至6月的三个月里，公司亏损2.99亿美元。公司说这次裁员要花8000万到9000万美元。"], "body": "Flutter will cut up to 1,400 jobs. Its boss said the company cannot pay the new betting taxes. Workers in Leeds and Dublin will be most affected. Some jobs in London, Sunderland, Malta and Gibraltar may also go.\n\nThe government raised taxes on online betting last year. The tax on online casino games went from 21% to 40% in April. A tax on online sports betting will rise from 15% to 25% next April.\n\nFlutter employs 28,500 people around the world. It has 9,000 workers in the UK and Ireland. The company lost $299m in the three months to June. It says the job cuts will cost $80m to $90m.", "body_zh": "Flutter将裁掉最多1400个工作岗位。老板说公司付不起新的博彩税。利兹和都柏林的员工受影响最大。伦敦、桑德兰、马耳他和直布罗陀的一些岗位也可能被裁。\n\n政府去年提高了线上博彩税。今年4月，线上赌场游戏的税率从21%涨到40%。明年4月，线上体育博彩的税率将从15%涨到25%。\n\nFlutter在全球有28500名员工，其中9000人在英国和爱尔兰。截至6月的三个月里，公司亏损2.99亿美元。公司说这次裁员要花8000万到9000万美元。", "text": "Flutter will cut up to 1,400 jobs. Its boss said the company cannot pay the new betting taxes. Workers in Leeds and Dublin will be most affected. Some jobs in London, Sunderland, Malta and Gibraltar may also go. The government raised taxes on online betting last year. The tax on online casino games went from 21% to 40% in April. A tax on online sports betting will rise from 15% to 25% next April. Flutter employs 28,500 people around the world. It has 9,000 workers in the UK and Ireland. The company lost $299m in the three months to June. It says the job cuts will cost $80m to $90m.", "vocab": [{"word": "cut jobs", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "裁员", "note": "常见新闻说法，也可说 cut 1,400 jobs", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "tax", "pos": "noun", "zh": "税", "note": "tax rise 就是“加税”", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "boss", "pos": "noun", "zh": "老板", "note": "口语里比 manager 更常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "affected", "pos"